<title>USA: RTRS-Tennis: Woodbridge/Woodforde win in doubles.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tennis: Woodbridge/Woodforde win in doubles.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top seeded Todd Woodbridge and Mark Woodforde of Australia defeated Sebatian Lareau and Alex O'Brien of the United States in the U.S. Open men's doubles quarter-finals 6-3 7-5.</p>
</text>
